  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "1 cup chopped onion",
    "1.5 tablespoons butter",
    "2 tablespoons paprika",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups chicken stock",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1 teaspoon all-purpose flour"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bMYRykiyMNUBJfBqm4t2TWde0vA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-1-BG-7563-f950d994c65e4d91a584d35fc141d3ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15456/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add chicken and pan-fry until cooked through and juices run clear, about 10 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove chicken from skillet and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sV-Mx4B4Rcx4s7gK5_0_ztKD5-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-2-BG-7572-506b9854313b45f5abe9eddcf2434b10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15456/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook onion in butter in the same skillet until translucent but not brown, about 5 to 8 minutes. Season with paprika and salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/25Mkw4g3rSeBaxACM_s_LlUUbmg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-5-BG-7579-0a822645af7642e5a035b9004c646d21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15456/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour chicken stock into the pan and bring to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SUOAQgKlZ1OW096nP_2JTXNxOcM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-6-BG-7585-1a58e62d78584b21af5a909fab4b48e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15456/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to simmer; mix sour cream with flour until smooth, then whisk into chicken stock.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lBLFtgWhLFw2bpcGHt7DJKX479Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-7-BG-7591-39e74534d068414f988663ad23b4ccf9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15456/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken in skillet; simmer until chicken is heated through and sauce has thickened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IQ2NyGnbl47LQaw_VKOSZPMUZ7o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15456-sour-cream-chicken-paprika-DDMFS-step-8-BG-7602-73c67d63db904d53b32ec38a09ccbdd7.jpg"
